Bundled upstream work
---------------------

The web application under src/static/ is the official DeepSeek "API 使用 demo"
(version 0.1.2) and remains:

    Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek
    Released under the MIT License.

Its files are redistributed unmodified except for a single i18n string in
src/static/js/main.*.js (the application name shown in the sidebar) and the
page title in src/index.html. The upstream LICENSE text is preserved verbatim
at src/LICENSE.

Third-party components
----------------------

The native shell uses Ionic Capacitor and its plugins; the web bundle ships
React, zustand, KaTeX, Prism, Mermaid (with cytoscape, dagre, d3 and dayjs)
and DOMPurify. Each retains its own licence. The authoritative list, with
links, is rendered inside the app at Settings → About.
